  "description": "No need for expensive lessons or a bulky piano!\nJoy Piano is an \"Edutainment\" game designed to help children build a solid musical foundation and feel the thrill of performing world-famous songs.\n\n■ Master the Basics: 23-Step Curriculum\nFrom rhythm and note reading to two-handed play and chords! Following our 23 structured lessons makes mastering piano basics natural and fun. Achieve the grand finale—playing \"Canon\"!\n\n■ 20 Beloved Global Classics & Nursery Rhymes\nFeaturing 20 hits like \"Twinkle Twinkle Little Star,\" \"Chopsticks,\" and \"Old MacDonald Had a Farm.\" Playing familiar tunes boosts confidence and focus.\n\n■ 2 Guided Learning Modes\n\nNote Mode: A visual, intuitive way to learn rhythm by following falling notes.\n\nSheet Music Mode: A practical mode to learn key positions by reading real notes.\n\nSpeed Control: Adjust the tempo to match your child's pace so they can finish every song with a smile.",
